{"slug":"find-the-index-of-the-first-occurrence","id":28,"title":"Find the Index of the First Occurrence in a String","difficulty":"Easy","tags":[],"fn":"strStr","params":[["haystack","string"],["needle","string"]],"types":["string","string"],"ret":"int","cmp":"exact","desc":"<p>給定兩個字串 <code>haystack</code> 和 <code>needle</code>，請在 <code>haystack</code> 字串中找出 <code>needle</code> 字串第一次出現的下標（從 0 開始）。</p>\n<p>如果 <code>needle</code> 不是 <code>haystack</code> 的一部分，則返回 <code>-1</code>。</p>","constraints":["1 ≤ haystack.length, needle.length ≤ 10⁴","haystack 和 needle 只包含小寫英文字母"],"starter":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def strStr(self, haystack: str, needle: str) -> int:\n        ","typescript":"function strStr(haystack: string, needle: string): number {\n    \n};","javascript":"/**\n * @param {string} haystack\n * @param {string} needle\n * @return {number}\n */\nvar strStr = function(haystack, needle) {\n    \n};","c":"int strStr(char* haystack, char* needle) {\n    \n}","cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int strStr(string haystack, string needle) {\n        \n    }\n};"},"examples":[{"args":["sadbutsad","sad"],"out":0},{"args":["leetcode","leeto"],"out":-1}],"tests":[{"args":["a","a"],"out":0},{"args":["aaa","aaaa"],"out":-1},{"args":["mississippi","issip"],"out":4},{"args":["aaabbaaabbabaaabaaaabbbabbaaabaaaabbabbabbbbaabbbbbbbbbbaaabbbaaa","bbaab"],"out":42},{"args":["bbabbbabbbabbababbaabaaabbbbbbbababaaaaabaabbaabaaaaaaabbbbaabbababbbaabbbbabaa","aab"],"out":18},{"args":["aabbbbabbaabbbbaabbababababbbaabbbaba","aabb"],"out":0},{"args":["bbbbbabbaabbbaabbaa","bbaab"],"out":6},{"args":["aaababbaa","baab"],"out":-1},{"args":["abaabababaaaababaabababaababbabaabbabbaaaabbbbbbaaaabbbaabbbaababb","baa"],"out":1},{"args":["bbababababaabbbaaaabb","a"],"out":2},{"args":["aabababaabaabbaaabaabbabbbabbbabbaababbbaaabbbaababbaaabaabababbabbaaabbaaba","aab"],"out":0},{"args":["abbaabababaabbaaaaabbbabbbaabb","bbaba"],"out":-1},{"args":["baabbbabbbaababaabababbaababbbabbababbbababbaabababaabaabb","abaabb"],"out":52},{"args":["abaabababbbababbaaabbaaabababaaaabaaaabbbbaabaaabbaaa","babb"],"out":6},{"args":["bbbbaabaabaaaabbaabaabbbbaaaaaaaaababaaaabbbaaba","b"],"out":0},{"args":["babbbbabbabaaababaabbbbbb","aa"],"out":11},{"args":["babaaaaaaaabbbbbabaaaababbaaababaabaaababaabbabbbaabbaabbababbbabbaabaaaaa","a"],"out":1},{"args":["bababaaaabaabababbaaababbaabababbbb","aab"],"out":7},{"args":["bbbbaabaabaaabbbabaabbaababaabbbaabaaaaababaaabb","ab"],"out":5},{"args":["ababbbbbbbbaaaaabbabbababbbaabbababbbbababbbbbaaabbbb","a"],"out":0},{"args":["abbbbabaabbbaabbbaabababbbbababbbabbbbabaabbbbbaab","bbbaba"],"out":2},{"args":["abababbaaaababbaaaabaaababaaabbaabbbababbaaaaaabaabbbbabbaabaaaaaaaabbbbabaab","aabba"],"out":27},{"args":["aaabbaaabbbabbbbaaabaaaababababaababababaaaabbabbbaabbaabbaaaabbabaaaabbbaabaaba","bab"],"out":10},{"args":["abaa","aa"],"out":2},{"args":["ababbabbbbbaaaabbbabbbaababbababbabbba","ba"],"out":1},{"args":["aaaaaaaaabababababaabbbaabbaaaabaabaabbbbbabbabaaababbababbaabbbaabbbababaab","abab"],"out":8},{"args":["abbabbbbbbbba","bbbbbb"],"out":4},{"args":["",""],"out":4999}],"ref":"// KMP：先建立 next（最長相等前後綴）表，再線性比對\n// 時間複雜度: O(m + n)，空間複雜度: O(n)\nfunction strStr(haystack, needle) {\n    const n = needle.length;\n    if (n === 0)\n        return 0;\n    const next = new Array(n).fill(0);\n    for (let i = 1, j = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && needle[i] !== needle[j])\n            j = next[j - 1];\n        if (needle[i] === needle[j])\n            j++;\n        next[i] = j;\n    }\n    for (let i = 0, j = 0; i < haystack.length; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && haystack[i] !== needle[j])\n            j = next[j - 1];\n        if (haystack[i] === needle[j])\n            j++;\n        if (j === n)\n            return i - n + 1;\n    }\n    return -1;\n}\n","solutions":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def strStr(self, haystack: str, needle: str) -> int:\n        n, m = len(haystack), len(needle)\n        if m == 0:\n            return 0\n        if m > n:\n            return -1\n\n        # 建立 KMP 前綴函數\n        nxt = [0] * m\n        k = 0\n        for i in range(1, m):\n            while k > 0 and needle[i] != needle[k]:\n                k = nxt[k - 1]\n            if needle[i] == needle[k]:\n                k += 1\n            nxt[i] = k\n\n        # 比對主字串，指標不回退\n        k = 0\n        for i in range(n):\n            while k > 0 and haystack[i] != needle[k]:\n                k = nxt[k - 1]\n            if haystack[i] == needle[k]:\n                k += 1\n            if k == m:\n                return i - m + 1\n        return -1","cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int strStr(string haystack, string needle) {\n        int n = haystack.size(), m = needle.size();\n        if (m == 0) return 0;\n        if (m > n) return -1;\n\n        vector<int> nxt(m, 0);\n        for (int i = 1, k = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            while (k > 0 && needle[i] != needle[k]) k = nxt[k - 1];\n            if (needle[i] == needle[k]) k++;\n            nxt[i] = k;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0, k = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            while (k > 0 && haystack[i] != needle[k]) k = nxt[k - 1];\n            if (haystack[i] == needle[k]) k++;\n            if (k == m) return i - m + 1;\n        }\n        return -1;\n    }\n};","java":"class Solution {\n    public int strStr(String haystack, String needle) {\n        int n = haystack.length(), m = needle.length();\n        if (m == 0) return 0;\n        if (m > n) return -1;\n\n        int[] next = new int[m];\n        for (int i = 1, k = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            while (k > 0 && needle.charAt(i) != needle.charAt(k)) k = next[k - 1];\n            if (needle.charAt(i) == needle.charAt(k)) k++;\n            next[i] = k;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0, k = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            while (k > 0 && haystack.charAt(i) != needle.charAt(k)) k = next[k - 1];\n            if (haystack.charAt(i) == needle.charAt(k)) k++;\n            if (k == m) return i - m + 1;\n        }\n        return -1;\n    }\n}","typescript":"// KMP：先建立 next（最長相等前後綴）表，再線性比對\n// 時間複雜度: O(m + n)，空間複雜度: O(n)\nfunction strStr(haystack: string, needle: string): number {\n    const n = needle.length;\n    if (n === 0) return 0;\n\n    const next = new Array(n).fill(0);\n    for (let i = 1, j = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && needle[i] !== needle[j]) j = next[j - 1];\n        if (needle[i] === needle[j]) j++;\n        next[i] = j;\n    }\n\n    for (let i = 0, j = 0; i < haystack.length; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && haystack[i] !== needle[j]) j = next[j - 1];\n        if (haystack[i] === needle[j]) j++;\n        if (j === n) return i - n + 1;\n    }\n    return -1;\n}\n","c":"// KMP：先建立 next（最長相等前後綴）表，再線性比對\n// 時間複雜度: O(m + n)，空間複雜度: O(n)\nint strStr(char* haystack, char* needle) {\n    int m = strlen(haystack), n = strlen(needle);\n    if (n == 0) return 0;\n\n    int* next = malloc(sizeof(int) * n);\n    next[0] = 0;\n    for (int i = 1, j = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && needle[i] != needle[j]) j = next[j - 1];\n        if (needle[i] == needle[j]) j++;\n        next[i] = j;\n    }\n\n    int ans = -1;\n    for (int i = 0, j = 0; i < m; i++) {\n        while (j > 0 && haystack[i] != needle[j]) j = next[j - 1];\n        if (haystack[i] == needle[j]) j++;\n        if (j == n) { ans = i - n + 1; break; }\n    }\n    free(next);\n    return ans;\n}\n"},"cDriver":"int main(void) {\n    char *lc_buf = lc_read_all(); const char *lc_p = lc_buf;\n    int lc_n = (int)strtol(lc_p, (char **)&lc_p, 10);\n    for (int lc_i = 0; lc_i < lc_n; lc_i++) {\n        LJ *lc_c = lj_parse(&lc_p);\n        lc_start(lc_i);\n        LB lc_o = {0};\n        double lc_t0, lc_ms;\n        char *a0 = lcc_str(&lc_c->a[0]);\n        char *a1 = lcc_str(&lc_c->a[1]);\n        lc_t0 = lc_now();\n        int lc_r = strStr(a0, a1);\n        lc_ms = lc_now() - lc_t0;\n        lb_ll(&lc_o, lc_r);\n        lc_result(lc_i, lc_ms, &lc_o);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}","cppDriver":"int main() {\n    char *lc_buf = lc_read_all(); const char *lc_p = lc_buf;\n    int lc_n = (int)strtol(lc_p, (char **)&lc_p, 10);\n    for (int lc_i = 0; lc_i < lc_n; lc_i++) {\n        LJ *lc_c = lj_parse(&lc_p);\n        lc_start(lc_i);\n        LB lc_o = {0};\n        double lc_t0, lc_ms;\n        string a0 = lcx::from<string>(&lc_c->a[0]);\n        string a1 = lcx::from<string>(&lc_c->a[1]);\n        Solution *lc_sol = new Solution();\n        lc_t0 = lc_now();\n        auto lc_r = lc_sol->strStr(a0, a1);\n        lc_ms = lc_now() - lc_t0;\n        lcx::put(&lc_o, lc_r);\n        lc_result(lc_i, lc_ms, &lc_o);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}"}